#: scenario3:scenario3_DEEBF9E7_AD5C_4EA7_BFC0_0BDEC2E7DFE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e2d246c39f0a1bb15f3e77196065224068613f5c37a028fef1a3304000daaf1
#. default-sha256: e4cc77344165bec3f89877dfc0741a6fcaa429be16ad4f4e4c962036719cbca9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DEEBF9E7_AD5C_4EA7_BFC0_0BDEC2E7DFE2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫His eyebrows were furrowed, creating deep creases on his "
"forehead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫그때……, ⟪k:8⟫야코포는 몹시 살벌한 표정을 짓고 있었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 603c7a417e9298bb8aceec36becd2a11d3b604f43551744c1a072a4e950b9e28
#. default-sha256: bcf73f0ce99de612e708ed22aa5a97fdd17f3c617766a60c45354891515c0288
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Several servants stood off to the side, watching their master attentively as he stomped past "
"them down the corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫성큼성큼 복도를 걷는 주인을 보고 ⟪k:1⟫고용인 몇 명이 무슨 일인가 싶어 눈을 휘둥그레 떴지만……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1348194619eb4885fc13e1297588c53194fa852379af51d837a99e6276a4b85
#. default-sha256: 4080e1d56f30516c95cea1e9408473466e2920eb9c94c5f0219b59708fd67406
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, no one said a word to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫누구도 말을 걸려 하진 않았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c32f0c352a1ba7e1bb770fc711bc095194e990cb91c57d5f540f925f3f91c0a7
#. default-sha256: 0a77d46cfaa9582c320dfbcfb443a0de3ee68d1f897d50101677aa377bd8a016
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had I not been preoccupied attending to his countryman..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 당시의 제가⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫야코포의 동향 사람을 상대하는 중이 아니었다면……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 047a7eecba6061b97a8544f1298590826f86f08d9b705448ab1db5007446d5aa
#. default-sha256: f504763f4615e436b2c1a7cb4d6e3aee5309dc2955ca1680664acbc55e6d0132
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I likely could have prevented it. ⟪k:1⟫The look on his face would have made it obvious "
"something bad was about to happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제가 ⟪k:1⟫말렸을 텐데 말이지요. ⟪k:2⟫저 표정은 ⟪k:3⟫보기만 해도 불길한 예감만 들지 않는지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c682aaa8e0c610f72c906293a3d43905992d0e0b34ddef2322a0cc149c829e19
#. default-sha256: 477de7bb3f40f88b1c239f04550759536875bde9339fd808a5572f45a9056d22
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Something that would serve only to further her misfortune."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀의 불행이 ⟪k:1⟫또 커질 것만 같은…… ⟪k:2⟫불길한 예감이요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28bc2967e52876fb8a1df99b095f2b38f2b8a889a887df56b2c861ec032da6f7
#. default-sha256: 7cd1cdd6d1b76aa98f1b8fad52c6e27fce1a2cb19af377f88a02855587152ef9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was already in a less-than-ideal situation..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이미 ⟪k:1⟫소녀의 처지는 ⟪k:2⟫결코 좋지 않건만――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9513dc644e4c35d29dcfc3e0a69eadba6baca8b90140c28840954dab0ba1ad54
#. default-sha256: 5d102593f017bda25a3352a094388d843592f4b1d3e17a48a6d2ab33f542475f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and it was perched on the edge of a hill, soon to begin rolling down into even worse "
"territory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그게 ⟪k:1⟫낭떠러지에서 추락하듯이 ⟪k:2⟫더 안 좋은 방향으로――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫변화하려는 ⟪k:5⟫순간이"
"었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_35EB0DD6_8F2D_43CF_B988_9B60E252CBA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 670bb0b315d3ad634dc1086013c18a8ee1687ec6fc71ed05a391a8972c756626
#. default-sha256: 90538024ccc26d33f755bd8e0344d07f22708f0a18b0217d367197fb77678e44
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_35EB0DD6_8F2D_43CF_B988_9B60E252CBA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9D9C0F1_53A4_45D8_ADF1_A00DF53E7815
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0dd2d367d898205b3e1c49f144e288656898626fc82e655b71dd1e583655b50
#. default-sha256: 73a368a9e18dc81ff102d2a3c39619b21efcae7719ab8c5cc27ac78bf2702ce7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9D9C0F1_53A4_45D8_ADF1_A00DF53E7815"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫J-⟪k:1⟫Jacopo?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫여, ⟪k:1⟫여보……?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_458D4615_C573_4AFB_8C6F_895C44935729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b301cde1d4adf91040b44c41515b56838a9fd26937974ec03eab28c05c27f576
#. default-sha256: bdfbb94de936e61793ae075eabc0393e69619658b69cbe1db692b44ef48c3815
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_458D4615_C573_4AFB_8C6F_895C44935729"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:1⟫If you wanted to visit,⟪k:2⟫you could have said something,⟪k:3⟫rather "
"than coming in without knocking..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어쩐 일이세요, ⟪k:1⟫갑자기―― 그게, ⟪k:2⟫노크도 안 하시고…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫오실 거라면 ⟪k:5⟫미리 한"
"마디 말씀이라도……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2CB44302_C7F4_4FBF_8044_6F8447035E76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81e16fd89b181e9865a94dec505270d86ae31f0f8243ed7e26468fdf88e981c5
#. default-sha256: 2e4fdf11619481b90e011af9b335edae59aa469811e11e626202ba115c885f07
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2CB44302_C7F4_4FBF_8044_6F8447035E76"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is that... ⟪k:1⟫really necessary?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……꼭 해야만 ⟪k:1⟫해……?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5D7311C3_EBB9_4D79_9679_B329368EC393
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 817dd667219c937344defdc084652600c272250ef8cee0d497341ea43892051b
#. default-sha256: 5a08e1eaee0601dd4fad45533279db0a6ef2591841b2635ad2911b6600223071
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5D7311C3_EBB9_4D79_9679_B329368EC393"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Pardon...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네………?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c7ece7fcf258e3fade4f925e7c275444fe8f4324545d07b547c140b279ca32b
#. default-sha256: 5399bad24ed32dff2c34c2573ebde917c794608f1516288b84f55f6b77d254fd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Is there something you so "
"desperately want to keep from me that I must ⟪k:12⟫knock⟪k:13⟫ before entering?! That I should "
"have to let you know in advance that I’m coming?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫노크를 해야 할 만큼 ⟪k:12⟫숨기고 싶"
"은 거라도 있어!? ⟪k:13⟫내가 여기 올 거라고 ⟪k:14⟫딴 놈한테 연락해야 하냐고!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ceca0fc36dfff38426942b17530fb819162cfbbb87e3cc964dc0a9c8a02bee3
#. default-sha256: e534ddd0e16f4f686808c9cbfce4a4497af8613fe73cb5d4f629c8e00d269181
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wh-⟪k:1⟫What— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어, ⟪k:1⟫어――, ⟪k:2⟫여보, ⟪k:3⟫그게 무슨……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2600a27c1940f5e7dc15b3e194235f6edfe1e0bd9230b5bfeac4bf951eb31f6f
#. default-sha256: 091194602db0d4075f1ff4ad708a965eb642ac4e9ac5ca2f63863ac3b0c5157a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well?! ⟪k:1⟫Is there?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You went to talk to ⟪k:5⟫him⟪k:6⟫ behind my back, I’m "
"told!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What’d you tell him?! You moan to him about my behavior?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어때! ⟪k:1⟫대답해 봐! ⟪k:2⟫나 몰래 그 놈한테 상담했어!?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫뭐라 했어? ⟪k:5⟫내 태도에 푸"
"념이라도 했어!?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ae1c1fdc485e0b9425a9df0f37d287db1bc139b46d744859dc9217848395159
#. default-sha256: d7b6f4da36306862a365b3186cf900158f9a17c7fe8aac8b841f0ac2bbbfa964
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ngh, ⟪k:17⟫that hurts!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫―――!? ⟪k:13⟫앗……! ⟪k:14⟫으, "
"⟪k:15⟫……아파요……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c00241c81c3800d25ad5c5e11c50800ae7f2e9af2821af70bd45981735ea698
#. default-sha256: b64d02e1c9fef47152b480c6409e32c020c72abe420d36cd486f87e5db536427
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You told him I’m rough with you?!⟪k:1⟫You cried on his shoulder because I’m not ⟪k:2⟫nice "
"enough⟪k:3⟫?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Him!⟪k:7⟫ Of all people!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가 쌀쌀맞다고!? ⟪k:1⟫살갑지 않다고 아양을 떨었어!?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫하필 ⟪k:4⟫그딴 놈한테!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85fcb7543beede8186aaf1a8aa7c39b340e544395ae127d041e7af1e6de21d80
#. default-sha256: 0172e5249c8496fcb2d31ba38813d6ca97882a7483835736aebaa7d58bacfd12
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫W-⟪k:13⟫Wait, Jacopo!⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫You’re mistaken! Let me—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫자, ⟪k:13⟫잠깐만요, ⟪k:14⟫여보"
"――!⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫오해하신 거예요, ⟪k:17⟫제 말을……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 367ac7e7b2d5c0e8097922f5795d81e368718518a7bf69f12dbcfb0e3f09f3c9
#. default-sha256: 7c1303f1819ddea89a11d4463f28148b8157ad3a3d64a4a62adebfa058b5762b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silence! Not a word! Not a single godforsaken word!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The only thing that comes out "
"of your mouth is excuses!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Lies and fabrication!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫시끄러워, ⟪k:1⟫입 닥쳐, ⟪k:2⟫닥쳐 닥쳐 닥쳐!!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫네 말은 죄다 변명이야, ⟪k:5⟫죄다 거짓"
"부렁이라고!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7237bd2eb6b4388908082035ac05fd4e02c3b202d8e2429bdee6ffd4a233f79f
#. default-sha256: 600873010ce9a27885d62cbe96465254a93b75df764cd355a71796276b3aa608
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You put on this sweet, innocent little girl act,⟪k:1⟫but what’s ⟪k:2⟫really⟪k:3⟫ going "
"through your head?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Maybe I should just rip that mask off your face!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫늘 조신한 척하며―― 속으론 무슨 생각을 하는 거야!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫아예 ⟪k:3⟫그 낯가죽을 확 벗겨 주"
"랴……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42c5b622d8f2c1daa2a34b0137a8dbb77dd9ca3cd5f90ecfb9bfc138017a13d7
#. default-sha256: ce6db45d393bbb2a751c914e428abb255b6bef101737b0280125c470ed23d9ba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫S-⟪k:1⟫Stop— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Jacopo!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그, ⟪k:1⟫그만, ⟪k:2⟫……여보……!"

